base_view: archeology_scan_large_public__pointcloud
label: Point Cloud Scans
description: Point-cloud scan records with row-level resolution, coverage, noise, and quality semantics.
fields:
- archeology_scan_large_public__pointcloud.*
- archeology_scan_large_public__personnel.*
- archeology_scan_large_public__projects.*
joins:
  archeology_scan_large_public__personnel: {}
  archeology_scan_large_public__projects: {}
ai_context: 'Reach related views through the declared joins on this topic instead of re-deriving relationships.

  Use the modeled business fields has_comprehensive_coverage, is_high_resolution_scan, is_premium_quality_scan, scan_coverage_effectiveness, scan_quality_score, scan_resolution_index rather than reconstructing their formulas.

  Domain definitions for this topic:

  - Archaeological Documentation Completeness (ADC): ADC = \left(\text{SQS} \times 0.4\right) + \left(\text{MFS} \times 0.4\right) + \left(\text{SCE} \times 0.2\right) - 5 \times \sqrt{\frac{\text{Noise Level (dB)}}{10}}, \text{ where higher values indicate more complete documentation with multiple quality factors.}'
